Embedded components
-------------------

The plugin jar bundles the following libraries, relocated under
ocs.internal.* so they cannot clash with the same libraries installed
separately in Fiji (for example by the sibling plugins).

Measurement cores, Copyright (c) 2026 Jamie Malcolm, BSD 3-Clause License:

  io.github.jay2owe:cpc-core 0.2.0         centroid coincidence
  io.github.jay2owe:volcoloc-core 0.1.0    volumetric and bounding-box overlap
  io.github.jay2owe:opa-core 0.4.0         cross-type spatial statistics
  io.github.jay2owe:territories-core 0.2.1 Voronoi territories
  io.github.jay2owe:oc3d-core 0.2.0        3D object measurement and UI helpers

JTS Topology Suite (org.locationtech.jts:jts-core 1.19.0)
  Dual-licensed under the Eclipse Public License 2.0 and the Eclipse
  Distribution License 1.0. This plugin takes JTS under the EDL 1.0,
  which is the BSD 3-Clause licence in substance, and so redistributes
  under BSD-3-Clause with the JTS notice retained. The notice travels in
  the jar at META-INF/licenses/JTS-LICENSE.txt.

ImageJ (net.imagej:ij) is not bundled; Fiji provides it at run time.
